    "Estimate compute demand across Data Factory, Spark, and Power BI; compare Fabric capacity tiers and pricing; design your data architecture; and export a decision report. The Engineering Workspace brings these tools together in saved scenarios.": "估算 Data Factory、Spark 和 Power BI 的计算需求，比较容量档位和价格，设计数据架构并导出决策报告。工程工作区将这些工具整合到可保存的场景中。",
    "How are the estimates calculated?": "如何计算估算值？",
    "Estimates use deterministic formulas and your workload inputs. The tools show assumptions, smoothing windows, pricing sources, and configurable headroom so you can understand the result and validate it with a representative workload.": "估算基于确定性公式和工作负载输入。工具显示假设、平滑窗口、定价来源及可配置的余量，便于理解结果并用代表性负载验证。",
    "Can I compare multiple scenarios?": "可以比较多个场景吗？",
